=== plain-80: width 80, height 24, profile notty, dark, glyphs ascii, plain
# environment refusals -----------------------------------------$
$
# Note$
# Mock: item 1's refusals before asking, on the root-login, pve9$
# and alpine324 hosts, and on a host whose hardn file was edited$
# by hand.$
$
# item 1 on root-login -----------------------------------------$
$
# Warning$
# hardn wasn't run with sudo, so there's no user to keep it for.$
# Run sudo hardn as that user.$
$
# item 1 on pve9 -----------------------------------------------$
$
# Warning$
# sudo isn't installed here.$
$
# item 1 on alpine324 ------------------------------------------$
$
# Warning$
# hardn has no doas rule for alice to keep HARDN_CONFIG on. Add$
# setenv { HARDN_CONFIG } to the rule that lets alice use doas.$
$
# item 1, hardn-env-alice edited -------------------------------$
$
# Warning$
# /etc/sudoers.d/hardn-env-alice holds a rule hardn didn't$
# write. Put hardn's back, or remove it.$
$
$

